hange on the board starts the run. We pull the item, its column values, and the source PDF straight from Monday.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_44", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1144, "y": -10, "width": 1742, "height": 420, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2120395275, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 253207297, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_45", "type": "text", "x": 1166, "y": 6, "width": 1698, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 937195260, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1234510746, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - PULL THE FIELDS OUT OF THE PDF", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - PULL THE FIELDS OUT OF THE PDF", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_46", "type": "text", "x": 1166, "y": 42, "width": 1698, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 555512016, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1063497604, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Text first, then one extraction step that returns a fixed JSON schema. Scanned PDFs get routed to OCR instead of failing.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Text first, then one extraction step that returns a fixed JSON schema. Scanned PDFs get routed to OCR instead of failing.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_47", "type": "rectangle", "x": 3154, "y": -54, "width": 720, "height": 362, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1708957521, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1679116189, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_48", "type": "text", "x": 3176, "y": -38, "width": 676, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2132480061, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 346094056, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - CHECK EVERYTHING BEFORE ANYTHING IS SENT", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - CHECK EVERYTHING BEFORE ANYTHING IS SENT", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_49", "type": "text", "x": 3176, "y": -2, "width": 676, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 714537755, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1929245187, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Required fields present, amounts parse as numbers, dates are real dates. Anything short of that\nstops here and a person looks at it.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Required fields present, amounts parse as numbers, dates are real dates. Anything short of that\nstops here and a person looks at it.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_50", "type": "rectangle", "x": 4072, "y": -118, "width": 1744, "height": 274, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e6c97a", "backgroundColor": "#fff5df", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1725048951, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1193309984, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_51", "type": "text", "x": 4094, "y": -102, "width": 1700, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8a5a00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 588093311, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1849076401, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - BUILD AND SEND THE PANDADOC CONTRACT", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "4 - BUILD AND SEND THE PANDADOC CONTRACT", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_52", "type": "text", "x": 4094, "y": -66, "width": 1700, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1195809358, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1783684942, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "PandaDoc builds the document from your template asynchronously, so we wait for draft status before sending it for signature.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "PandaDoc builds the document from your template asynchronously, so we wait for draft status before sending it for signature.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_53", "type": "rectangle", "x": 6016, "y": 90, "width": 1048, "height": 218, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8fd0d8", "backgroundColor": "#e4f7f9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1540910401, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1633982922, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_54", "type": "text", "x": 6038, "y": 106, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0e5f6a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 991070208, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 648200382, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "5 - WHEN SOMETHING BREAKS, EVERYONE KNOWS", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "5 - WHEN SOMETHING BREAKS, EVERYONE KNOWS", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_55", "type": "text", "x": 6038, "y": 142, "width": 1004, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 356416555, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 756849393, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Any node failing anywhere in the run posts to Slack and writes the failure back onto the Monday item. Nothing goes quiet.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Any node failing anywhere in the run posts to Slack and writes the failure back onto the Monday item. Nothing goes quiet.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_1", "type": "rectangle", "x": -68, "y": 188, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2d6a4f", "backgroundColor": "#b7e4c7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1390851129, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 647892280, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_2"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_56"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_2", "type": "text", "x": -56.0, "y": 211.25, "width": 256, "height": 38, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1695753999, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 207388625, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - Monday.com Item Moved to\nReady for Contract", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_1", "originalText": "1 - Monday.com Item Moved to\nReady for Contract", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_3", "type": "rectangle", "x": 280, "y": 188, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0e5f6a", "backgroundColor": "#b5e5ec", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupI